# Ultra Things

Things 3 task manager integration.

## When to Use
 "Add task", "What\'s due today?", "Create project"

## Commands

```bash
# Add task
open 'things:///add?title=Buy%20groceries&when=today&tags=errands'

# Add to project
open 'things:///add?title=Write%20tests&list=CoreBlow&when=tomorrow'

# Show today
open 'things:///show?id=today'

# Via AppleScript
osascript -e 'tell application "Things3" to make new to do with properties {name:"Task name", due date:date "2025-02-01"}'
```
